Package: jp2a-studio
Version: __VERSION__
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pil, jp2a
Maintainer: jp2a Studio <Sicklingamer@gmail.com>
Homepage: __HOMEPAGE__
Description: Live, sleek local GUI for the jp2a ASCII-art converter
 jp2a Studio is a small local web app that wraps the jp2a command-line
 tool with a modern, dark, glassmorphism control panel. Drop in an image
 (or paste one, or fetch it from a URL) and every render is genuine jp2a
 output, updated live as you tweak width, colors, edges, borders and
 character palettes. Ships with copy/download of both plain-text and
 colored HTML output.
